/-!
# A260385

Numbers such that n divides A260519(n), where A260519(n) is the concatenation of the positions of the digits 0, 1, ..., 9 in n, positions counted from the right, and 0 if a given digit does not occur.

The 56 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A260385

